# build's own transcribed voice lines, tu_wide.py)
callout time_up           878   # Better luck next time.

# ---- PAD-420: held coils by their board address (generation C)
# (coils/coil_job_c3.sh: held 2000 ms as a mode started, ONE command at the game's own powers, ended on the board
# by itself; let go early by a mode stop, the game's OFF). A Pro has one of Foo Fighters LE's three: the van up post,
# device 12 - its command 0x80fd0 (255 for 32 ms, then 128) is the twin of the LE's van post call
data coil_count            0x03be7b5c
data coil_table            0x03bd7134
value magnet_proc          13185
text van_up_post_label    Van up post
text van_up_post_drive    9 7 255 32 128
text held_coils            van_up_post

